      "id": "intro-1",
      "kind": "intro",
      "scene": "stars",
      "text": "Hello, little one. Are you all cozy? Pull your blanket up, right up to your chin. There. Now look out the window, way up high, at all the twinkly stars. Do you see the brightest one? The one that blinks, like it's saying hello? That one is watching over you tonight."
    },
    {
      "id": "intro-2",
      "kind": "intro",
      "scene": "letter",
      "text": "Every so often, when the stars are just right, a story drifts across the ocean, all the way to your window. Tonight's story is about a girl named Pip, who wanted a home with no corners at all. Are you ready? Here we go."
